Seekwave SV6160 / Rockchip RK915 experimental 4.19 port

Imported from the local codeberg.org/aenertia/sv6160-rk915 clone at
3160b3242fe3155eaf6a5458943275b57c3dcd1f. Original copyright and GPL-2.0
notices are retained. See seekwave-assessment.md at the kernel root for
API changes, host compatibility, limitations and verification results.

This driver implements Wi-Fi only. Upstream scanning and association are
incomplete. Compilation is not evidence of working radio communication.
No Bluetooth transport or Android BT HAL is supplied by this driver.

Required firmware names: ssv6160-fw.bin and ssv6160-patch.bin.
Use scripts/grc802/firmware.mk to install from the external report directory.
